  <h3>Notes on known issues</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>If stored JSON is corrupted, the server returns the raw content as <code>text/plain</code> (this avoids sending invalid JSON body with a JSON content-type). This behaviour is documented in the report and covered by a unit test.</li>
    <li>The Dockerfile currently copies <code>tests/.htpasswd</code> into the build stage. It's included for test convenience; if you want a production-only image, remove test files from the final runtime image.</li>
  </ul>

